OAI.CompactBanach.main : ∃ Λ, ∀ (B : Type u_1) [inst : NormedAddCommGroup B] [inst_1 : NormedSpace ℝ B] [CompleteSpace B], ¬FiniteDimensional ℝ B → ∃ K, IsCompact K ∧ OAI.CompactBanach.DoublingAtMost K Λ ∧ ∀ (E : Type u_2) [inst_3 : NormedAddCommGroup E] [inst_4 : NormedSpace ℝ E] [FiniteDimensional ℝ E], ¬OAI.CompactBanach.AdmitsBiLipschitzEmbedding K E def OAI.CompactBanach.DoublingAtMost.{u_1} : {B : Type u_1} → [MetricSpace B] → Set B → ℕ → Prop := fun {B} [MetricSpace B] K bound => ∀ (x : ↑K) (r : ℝ), 0 < r → ∃ centers, centers.card ≤ bound ∧ ∀ (y : ↑K), dist y x < r → ∃ c ∈ centers, dist y c < r / ↑2 def OAI.CompactBanach.AdmitsBiLipschitzEmbedding.{u_1, u_2} : {B : Type u_1} → [MetricSpace B] → Set B → (E : Type u_2) → [MetricSpace E] → Prop := fun {B} [MetricSpace B] K E [MetricSpace E] => ∃ f a, 0 < a ∧ ∃ D, 1 ≤ D ∧ ∀ (x y : ↑K), a * dist x y ≤ dist (f x) (f y) ∧ dist (f x) (f y) ≤ D * a * dist x y 